10
00:43:02,608 --> 00:43:08,608
The Nutcracker and the Four Realms is a 2018 American Christmas
fantasy film directed by Lasse Hallström and Joe Johnston.

11
00:47:20,869 --> 00:47:26,869
It is a retelling of both the 1816 short story "The Nutcracker and the Mouse King" and the 1892 ballet The Nutcracker, about a
young girl who is gifted a locked egg from her deceased mother and sets out in a magical land to retrieve the key.

12
00:51:39,130 --> 00:51:45,130
The film stars Keira Knightley, Mackenzie Foy, Eugenio
Derbez, Matthew Macfadyen, Richard E.

13
00:55:57,391 --> 00:56:03,391
Grant, Misty Copeland, Helen Mirren, and Morgan Freeman.

14
01:00:15,652 --> 01:00:21,652
The film was announced in March 2016 with Hallström
directing from a script by Powell.

15
01:04:33,913 --> 01:04:39,913
Much of the cast signed on that summer, and filming began in October
at Pinewood Studios, lasting through January 2017.

16
01:08:52,173 --> 01:08:58,173
In December 2017, it was announced Johnston would direct a month of reshoots,
with Hallström agreeing to Johnston receiving co-directing credit.

17
01:13:10,434 --> 01:13:16,434
The reshoots were written by Tom McCarthy, who went uncredited,
and Powell received a sole credit as screenwriter.

18
01:17:28,695 --> 01:17:34,695
Composer James Newton Howard scored the film, adapting elements from Tchaikovsky's music for the 1892
ballet, while Gustavo Dudamel served as conductor, leading the London Philharmonia Orchestra.

19
01:21:46,956 --> 01:21:52,956
The Nutcracker and the Four Realms premiered at the Dolby Theatre in Los Angeles on October 29, 2018, and
was released by Walt Disney Studios Motion Pictures in the United States on November 2.

20
01:26:05,217 --> 01:26:11,217
The film was a box office disappointment, grossing $174 million worldwide against a
production budget between $120–133 million and losing Disney over $65 million.

21
01:30:23,478 --> 01:30:29,478
It received generally negative reviews, with criticisms of its story and Knightley's
performance, although the film's visual effects and aesthetics were praised.

22
01:34:41,739 --> 01:34:47,739
The film explores themes of princess, magic, fairy
tale, betrayal, magical object.
